OL,3,GNEWSAFootballers hurt in hit-and-run
OL,4,A'in good spirits'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour footballers who were injured in a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run in Leicester city centre
OL,8,Fare "very grateful to be here with us".
OL,10,FThe men, who play for non-league
OL,11,FLutterworth Town FC Reserves, were
OL,12,Fstruck by a vehicle in Vaughan Way
OL,13,Fshortly after 22:00 BST on 26
OL,14,FSeptember, with two suffering serious
OL,15,Finjuries.
OL,17,FJosh Dixon, a member of the club's
OL,18,Fcommittee, told the BBC they were "in
OL,19,Fgood spirits considering what happened"
OL,20,Fand everyone at the club had been
OL,21,F"rallying around each other".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
